WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
DALIguro's landing page: one workspace for planning, records, assessment and school forms.

00:08.500 --> 00:27.500
The teaching dashboard: today's next step, attendance not yet recorded, draft scores and learners to review.

00:27.500 --> 00:52.500
Class Program: build each subject's weekly schedule. The schedule audit checks it before printing.

00:52.500 --> 01:10.500
E-Grading: pick a section and subject to open its gradebook, term by term.

01:10.500 --> 01:20.500
Lesson planning: choose the level, cluster, subject and term, and DALI drafts an ILAW lesson plan.

01:20.500 --> 01:34.500
Consolidated grades: subject scores flow into one matrix, with missing cells flagged.

01:34.500 --> 01:40.000
The SF9 report card, filled from the same records.
